      "id": 58579,
      "is_admin": false,
      "is_moderator": false,
      "is_staff": false,
      "last_edit_date": 0,
      "message_parsed": "К инструкции по установке мода (адаптация к R561):<br />\n <br />\n<b>functions_post.php</b>:<br />\n <br />\nнайти:<br />\n<pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"php\">if ($mode == &#039;newtopic&#039; || ($mode == &#039;editpost&#039; &amp;&amp; $post_data[&#039;first_post&#039;]))</pre>заменить:<br />\n<pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"php\">if ($mode == &#039;newtopic&#039; || ($mode == &#039;editpost&#039; &amp;&amp; $post_data[&#039;first_post&#039;]) || (!$to_draft &amp;&amp; $to_draft != $post_data[&#039;is_draft&#039;]))</pre> <br />\nнайти:<br />\n<pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"php\">&quot; . BB_TOPICS . &quot; (topic_title, topic_poster, topic_time, forum_id, topic_status, topic_type, topic_dl_type</pre>после, на линии вставить:<br />\n<pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"php\">, is_draft</pre><br />\nнайти:<br />\n<pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"php\">VALUES\n                                (&#039;$post_subject&#039;, &quot; . $userdata[&#039;user_id&#039;] . &quot;, $current_time, $forum_id, &quot; . TOPIC_UNLOCKED . &quot;, $topic_type, $topic_dl_type</pre>после, на линии вставить:<br />\n<pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"php\">, $to_draft</pre> <br />\nнайти:<br />\n<pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"php\">$sql_update = &quot;\n                        UPDATE\n                                &quot; . BB_TOPICS . &quot;\n                        SET\n                                topic_title = &#039;$post_subject&#039;,\n                                topic_type = $topic_type,\n                                topic_dl_type = $topic_dl_type</pre>после вставить:<br />\n<pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"php\">, is_draft = $to_draft</pre>",
